droiddeck (1.0.4~noble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Files tab: Push here opens a file picker. The picker failed silently on
    every desktop, which also broke the Apps tab's APK picker and the Screen
    tab's Save. Desktops without an XDG desktop portal get GTK's own dialog.
  * Apps tab: cancelling the APK picker no longer opens a typed-path prompt.
  * Shell tab: Ctrl+C copies selected text and still interrupts when nothing
    is selected; a right click opens a Copy/Paste menu. Ctrl+Shift+V and
    Shift+Insert paste, Ctrl+Insert copies, and select all moves to
    Ctrl+Shift+A so Ctrl+A reaches the shell.

 -- Dhiva Labs <dhivakar1010@gmail.com>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 02:42:54 +0530

droiddeck (1.0.3~noble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * First upload to the Dhiva Labs PPA.
  * Files tab: rename files and folders. A name that is already taken is
    refused rather than overwritten, and a case-only change works on the
    case-insensitive /sdcard.
  * The New folder and Rename dialogs reject a name that contains "/" or is
    "." or "..".

 -- Dhiva Labs <dhivakar1010@gmail.com>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 05:07:07 +0530
